463
00:58:36,639 --> 00:58:40,639
身を寄せてやまない穴嵐をどこへやら
Where did that ceaseless storm we huddled against go?

464
00:58:40,639 --> 00:58:44,479
まだまだ心は変えれない
My heart still cannot change.

465
00:58:44,479 --> 00:58:48,579
そろそろ氷の溶かすでもかまして遅れ
It's about time you melt the ice and be late.

466
00:58:48,579 --> 00:58:52,379
からからに枯れ果てているまで
Until I am dried up and withered.

467
00:58:52,379 --> 00:58:56,339
ぷらぷら揺れて舞い散るおもかげ 少し陰りには幻
Swaying idly, scattering traces of memories, a slight shadow like an illusion.

468
00:58:56,479 --> 00:58:59,679
聞きたいことも 言いたい思いも
Things I want to hear, feelings I want to express,

469
00:58:59,679 --> 00:59:03,879
笑うくらい山ほど終わって それでもあなた
Piling up enough to make you laugh, yet you...

470
00:59:03,879 --> 00:59:10,739
の前にするとなにも出てこないなんて
Before you, nothing ever comes out.

471
00:59:11,239 --> 00:59:15,339
底突く痛みも 穿し込む痺れも
The bottomless pain, the piercing numbness,

472
00:59:15,339 --> 00:59:19,039
口をすぐんだ恋しさは分かって
Understand this tightly sealed yearning.

473
00:59:19,039 --> 00:59:25,539
あなたの心に足をかける大事な来遊歌と信じたんだ
I believed it was an important welcoming song stepping into your heart.

474
00:59:42,379 --> 00:59:48,479
どうかったまして遅れ 愛と笑って遅れ
Please make it up to me and be late, laugh with love and be late.

475
00:59:48,479 --> 00:59:55,679
いつか消える日までそのままでいて どうかったまして遅れ
Stay just like that until the day it fades someday, please make it up to me and be late.

476
00:59:55,679 --> 01:00:01,179
愛と笑って遅れ いつか消える日までそのままでいて
Laugh with love and be late, stay just like that until the day it fades someday.

477
01:00:01,620 --> 01:00:06,500
言いたいことも言えないまま どこかで待ちぼうけ
Unable to say what I wanted to say, waiting somewhere in vain...

478
01:00:06,820 --> 01:00:09,470
愛とか笑って遅れ
Laughing off love, running late...

479
01:00:09,650 --> 01:00:12,550
言いたいことも言えないまま
Unable to say what I wanted to say...

480
01:00:13,200 --> 01:00:19,800
断りするのも 形にするのも そのどれもがぼくじゃなくて
Rejecting things, shaping things... none of them felt like me.

481
01:00:20,800 --> 01:00:27,850
斜めを見つめた するとあなたはもっと優しく笑ってんだ
I gazed sideways, and you smiled even more gently.

482
01:00:28,950 --> 01:00:35,550
すさんだ心も さざめく秘密も 気づけばかなしみだって
A desolate heart, rippling secrets—before I knew it, they were sorrow.

483
01:00:36,250 --> 01:00:43,150
葛藤のあかりに 痛む耳元 恋だかららを走ってたんだ
In the light of conflict, ears stinging, I was running because it was love.

484
01:01:09,350 --> 01:02:21,621
[Title: GIGI ROOM PARTY! GIGI MURIN BIRTHDAY HOUSE PARTY]

